# Wiki Index

> This file is **not** tracked in git — `wiki/index.md` is regenerated
> automatically from page frontmatter after every ingest (see `CLAUDE.md` /
> `AGENTS.md`, "Ingest workflow"). This `.example` file shows the format a
> real `wiki/index.md` takes, with fictional entries.

